    "AI 翻译会在整句说完后逐字出现，不支持边说边译": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI translation appears word by word after each sentence is finished; translate-while-speaking isn't available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI（OpenAI 兼容接口）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI (OpenAI-compatible API)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "API Key 只保存在本机。使用云端识别时，录音会发送到该服务商的服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your API key stays on this Mac. With cloud recognition, your audio is sent to this provider's servers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 无效或没有权限（HTTP %lld）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invalid API key or access denied (HTTP %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent 完成或请求确认时，Passport 响铃并亮屏，状态条也会提醒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the agent finishes or asks for approval, Passport chimes and lights up, and the floating pill shows a notice too"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent 通知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent Notifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Speech 不支持%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Speech doesn't support %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Speech 与云端流式服务的字幕延迟最低；其他本地模型按句识别，准确率更高。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Speech and cloud streaming services give the lowest caption latency. Other local models transcribe sentence by sentence for higher accuracy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Azure AI Translator，稳定、免费额度大": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Azure AI Translator: reliable, generous free tier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code\nSwiftUI\nInputBetter": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Esc（打断）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esc (Interrupt)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "F0 免费层每月 200 万字符": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F0 free tier: 2M characters per month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FoloToy AI Passport 是 InputBetter 的硬件搭档：按住说话、一键发送，Agent 完成时提醒你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FoloToy AI Passport is InputBetter's hardware companion: hold to talk, send with one press, and get notified when your agent is done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google Cloud Translation，语种最全，速度快": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google Cloud Translation: widest language coverage, fast"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google 翻译": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google Translate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputBetter": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "InputBetter 不保存字幕历史：记录只在内存中，下次开始字幕或退出后清除。结束字幕后会打开字幕记录窗口，可以在那里查看、翻译、总结和保存；字幕进行中可以点字幕条上的 %@ 打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputBetter doesn't keep caption history: the transcript lives only in memory and is cleared when you start new captions or quit. After you end captions, the Transcript window opens so you can review, translate, summarize and save it; while captions are running, click %@ on the caption bar to open it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "InputBetter 设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "InputBetter Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
