    "「%@」的这场字幕记录（%lld 句）还没保存，开始新的字幕后会被替换。需要保留的话，先打开字幕记录保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcript for “%@” (%lld lines) hasn't been saved and will be replaced when new captions start. To keep it, open the transcript and save it first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【AI 总结】": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[AI Summary]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【字幕】": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Captions]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一句话还没说完就先给出暂定译文（略暗），说完后换成整句译文。在线服务下消耗的额度约为整句翻译的 2–3 倍": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows a provisional translation (dimmed) before a sentence is finished, then replaces it with the full-sentence translation. With online services this uses about 2–3× the quota of sentence-only translation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一句话还没说完就先给出暂定译文（略暗），说完后换成整句译文。系统翻译在本机完成，没有额外开销": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows a provisional translation (dimmed) before a sentence is finished, then replaces it with the full-sentence translation. System Translation runs on this Mac, so there's no extra cost"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一键配置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set Up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一键配置会写入各自的 hook 配置，只追加 InputBetter 自己的条目；原文件会先备份为 .inputbetter.bak。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set Up adds InputBetter's hooks to each tool's hook config without touching your existing entries. The original file is backed up first as .inputbetter.bak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
